WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.527
Your experience is your advantage.

00:00:02.527 --> 00:00:05.151
Put it to work on your next opportunity.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.201
But strong bids take more than expertise.

00:00:10.201 --> 00:00:11.954
They take the right evidence,

00:00:11.954 --> 00:00:14.532
connected at the right moment.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.852
BidStream connects tender discovery with your company's capabilities.

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:22.801
Inspect the source, understand the match,

00:00:22.801 --> 00:00:26.400
and shortlist the opportunities worth pursuing.

00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:31.243
Turn that shortlist into a tailored expression of interest.

00:00:31.243 --> 00:00:33.624
Review the requirements and evidence,

00:00:33.624 --> 00:00:36.317
then approve your email to the buyer.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.503
When the buyer responds, bring the tender documents into

00:00:40.503 --> 00:00:44.532
the pursuit. Keep the brief and conversation together.

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:47.600
AI scans the tender document,

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:51.188
reading the text and identifying the required forms.

00:00:51.188 --> 00:00:54.102
Requirements, evaluation criteria,

00:00:54.102 --> 00:00:57.422
and response templates become structured information,

00:00:57.422 --> 00:00:59.605
linked back to the source.

00:01:00.647 --> 00:01:04.525
Connect Google Drive. The tender structure becomes a clear

00:01:04.525 --> 00:01:08.832
folder structure, and the extracted forms move into place:

00:01:08.832 --> 00:01:11.177
source documents, technical response,

00:01:11.177 --> 00:01:14.625
financial offer, and declarations.

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.468
Around that shared workspace,

00:01:17.468 --> 00:01:20.835
specialist AI agents bring in technical content,

00:01:20.835 --> 00:01:23.528
team experience, financial inputs,

00:01:23.528 --> 00:01:28.056
and legal checks. They populate the forms and draft documents,

00:01:28.056 --> 00:01:30.448
using your company's evidence.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.452
The package comes together: draft responses,

00:01:34.452 --> 00:01:37.924
an evaluation report, a criteria-based score,

00:01:37.924 --> 00:01:40.605
and sourced competitor analysis.

00:01:40.605 --> 00:01:43.496
Review the reasoning, check the evidence,

00:01:43.496 --> 00:01:46.201
and resolve the remaining gaps.

00:01:47.247 --> 00:01:49.453
Then BidStream asks you to review,

00:01:49.453 --> 00:01:53.807
sign, and send. Your authorised team confirms the documents

00:01:53.807 --> 00:01:57.650
and submission route, and makes the final decision.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.546
BidStream. Turn the experience you've earned into the opportunity

00:02:02.546 --> 00:02:05.553
you pursue next. Start the conversation.
